---
import Demo from '../../layouts/Demo.astro';
---
<Demo title="Gesture playground" description="Use your hand to move a cursor inside this page with the project's trained gesture classifier.">
<div class="grid"><section class="panel"><h2>1. Start your camera</h2><p>Camera frames are processed locally and are not uploaded. Model files download when you start. Good lighting and a visible hand help.</p><div class="camera"><video id="camera" autoplay playsinline muted></video><canvas id="landmarks"></canvas></div><button id="start">Start camera</button><button id="stop" class="secondary" disabled>Stop camera</button><p id="status" role="status">Camera is off.</p><label for="sample">Or test recorded gesture landmarks</label><select id="sample"><option value="0">Index finger</option><option value="1">Index and thumb</option><option value="2">Index and pinky</option><option value="3">Index and middle</option></select><button id="sample-run" class="secondary">Test recorded gesture</button><img id="sample-image" alt="Sample hand gesture" hidden/></section><section class="panel"><h2>2. Try the controls</h2><p id="result" aria-live="polite">Waiting for a hand</p><div id="playground"><span id="cursor" hidden></span><button id="target">Hit me</button><div style="height:600px;padding:15px;pointer-events:none"><small>Move the cursor onto the button, then use the click gesture.<br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/>Scroll gesture moves this panel.</small></div></div><p id="hits">Targets hit: 0</p><ul><li>Index finger: move</li><li>Index + thumb: click</li><li>Index + pinky: alternate click</li><li>Index + middle: scroll</li></ul><p>The original app controls a desktop mouse. This browser adaptation only controls this playground. The classifier was trained on a small personal dataset and may not generalize to every hand.</p></section></div>
<script>import '../../scripts/gesture-demo';</script>
</Demo>
